DESCRIPTION:2F arrivals\, JAL ABC or Yamato counter: ski bag delivery to Th
 e Setsumon\, Hirafu. Arrives about Dec 12–13. Cash\, plus the hotel's ad
 dress and phone (+81 136-23-1724) for the form. Only send it once The Sets
 umon has said they'll hold it.\n≈ ¥3\,500 cash\nDay 1: Land\, ship the 
 board\, Arakichō
